WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.635
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.635 --> 00:00:03.770
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:04.971
And now we're gonna
get to the news.

00:00:04.971 --> 00:00:07.874
The 94th Academy Awards
were held last night

00:00:07.874 --> 00:00:10.576
and featured
the first live performance

00:00:10.576 --> 00:00:12.244
of "We don't Talk About Bruno"

00:00:12.244 --> 00:00:14.714
from the Disney musical
"Encanto,"

00:00:14.714 --> 00:00:17.183
followed by an unbelievable live
performance of

00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:19.819
"We Don't Talk About Jada."
[ Laughter ]

00:00:19.819 --> 00:00:21.554
[ Applause ]

00:00:21.554 --> 00:00:26.192
Well, remember 24 hours ago when
we thought Timothée Chalamet's

00:00:26.192 --> 00:00:30.330
sternum was the craziest thing
we'd see all night?

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:31.864
That's right.
Will Smith walked onstage

00:00:31.864 --> 00:00:33.232
during last night's
Academy Awards show

00:00:33.232 --> 00:00:34.801
and slapped Chris rock
in the face.

00:00:34.801 --> 00:00:37.136
And I got to say
the last thing I ever expected

00:00:37.136 --> 00:00:39.973
to see at the Oscars was a
display of narcissism.

00:00:39.973 --> 00:00:42.408
[ Laughter ]

00:00:42.408 --> 00:00:44.177
We'll have more on this story
in a little bit,

00:00:44.177 --> 00:00:45.711
but first let me
do the rest of the monologue,

00:00:45.711 --> 00:00:48.882
which is kind of terrifying
now that I know

00:00:48.882 --> 00:00:51.284
you can get slapped
for doing a bad joke.

00:00:51.284 --> 00:00:57.524
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.524 --> 00:00:59.525
During his speech
on Saturday in Poland,

00:00:59.525 --> 00:01:01.694
President Biden spoke directly
to the Russian people

00:01:01.694 --> 00:01:03.162
and said that
President Vladimir Putin

00:01:03.162 --> 00:01:05.998
was to blame for
Western economic sanctions.

00:01:05.998 --> 00:01:08.000
'Cause if there's one thing
Biden loves,

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.870
it's pointing fingers.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:12.805
During a rally in Georgia
on Saturday,

00:01:12.805 --> 00:01:14.940
Republican Congresswoman
Marjorie Taylor Greene

00:01:14.940 --> 00:01:16.609
attacked
transportation secretary

00:01:16.609 --> 00:01:19.278
Pete Buttigieg and said, "He and
his husband can stay out

00:01:19.278 --> 00:01:20.746
of our girls' bathrooms."

00:01:20.746 --> 00:01:23.283
Well, I can't believe I'm going
to say this -- she's right.

00:01:23.283 --> 00:01:24.450
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:26.185
Men use the men's bathroom.

00:01:26.185 --> 00:01:30.089
She got --
she got one right.

00:01:30.089 --> 00:01:32.659
According to a new report,
Supreme Court justice

00:01:32.659 --> 00:01:35.828
Clarence Thomas' wife Ginni
discussed ways to

00:01:35.828 --> 00:01:37.964
overturn the 2020 election
with then White House

00:01:37.964 --> 00:01:39.198
chief of staff Mark Meadows.

00:01:39.198 --> 00:01:41.300
But don't worry,
she'll get her comeuppance

00:01:41.300 --> 00:01:44.270
when she's eliminated first
on "dancing with the stars."

00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:47.740
[ Laughter ]
Pepsi --

00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:49.208
[ Laughter ]

00:01:49.208 --> 00:01:52.478
You guys, Pepsi has --
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.478 --> 00:01:54.347
Pepsi has announced a
partnership with

00:01:54.347 --> 00:01:58.317
the restaurant chain IHOP to
offer a Pepsi maple syrup.

00:01:58.317 --> 00:01:59.719
Great if you love Pepsi,

00:01:59.719 --> 00:02:02.388
but you wish it took half an
hour to pour one.

00:02:02.388 --> 00:02:06.059
[ Laughter ]

